1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,333
<i> Give that to me.</i>

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,300
<i>- [GUN FIRING]
- [BOTTLES SHATTERING]</i>

3
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:04,367
<i>- Not bad.
- How? You're an expert.</i>

4
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,167
<i>- Hi, Godfather!
- Golda.</i>

5
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,633
<i> I brought a gift for you.</i>

6
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:09,433
<i> Braganza is coming!</i>

7
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:11,133
<i>There's going to be a party at
Godfather's place.</i>

8
00:00:11,267 --> 00:00:13,100
<i>Looks like the transaction
will happen there.</i>

9
00:00:13,233 --> 00:00:14,433
<i> Then we need to get in.</i>

10
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:16,000
<i> Guess who got an invite.</i>

11
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:18,300
<i> My boss said she's bringing me</i>

12
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:19,367
<i> to a party.</i>

13
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,533
<i> You, Joey, do you have plans?</i>

14
00:00:21,667 --> 00:00:23,433
<i> The theme is Great Gatsby.</i>

15
00:00:23,567 --> 00:00:25,367
<i>What should I do?
I have nothing to wear.</i>

16
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,733
<i> We didn't prepare.</i>

17
00:00:26,867 --> 00:00:28,700
<i> This will be the biggest</i>

18
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:32,133
<i>and most extravagant deal
of the nation!</i>

19
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:33,800
<i> Long live the king!</i>

20
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:36,033
<i> Happy birthday, Godfather.</i>

21
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:37,933
<i> Has my gift arrived yet?</i>

22
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:39,333
<i> I'll call her, Godfather,</i>

23
00:00:39,467 --> 00:00:40,633
<i> and I'll update you.</i>

24
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:42,333
<i> For now, chill!</i>

25
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:43,767
<i> Take care of this.</i>

26
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:46,400
<i>If something goes wrong,
just walk away.</i>

27
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:48,200
<i>What matters is
that you stay safe.</i>

28
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:51,667
<i> Secure all entrances and exits</i>

29
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,000
<i> of this place</i>

30
00:00:53,133 --> 00:00:55,033
<i> once Braganza's group arrives.</i>

31
00:00:55,167 --> 00:00:56,833
<i> If he disrupts this night,</i>

32
00:00:56,967 --> 00:00:59,767
<i> make sure no one leaves alive.</i>

33
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,400
<i>Wait a moment, Ma'am.
Just SOP.</i>

34
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:02,867
<i> [DETECTOR BEEPING]</i>

35
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,333
<i>Sir, please don't tell anyone,
okay?</i>

36
00:01:04,467 --> 00:01:07,300
<i> Because my necklace is fake.</i>

37
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:08,367
<i> You may enter now.</i>

38
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,400
<i> Catalina Esperanza?</i>

39
00:01:09,533 --> 00:01:12,400
<i>I'll take you to the performers'
area.</i>

40
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:24,133
<i> [OBB]</i>

41
00:01:29,867 --> 00:01:33,833
[JAZZ MUSIC PLAYING]

42
00:01:34,967 --> 00:01:36,467
Stay here.

43
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,500
Ah...

44
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:39,033
is that Godfather?

45
00:01:39,167 --> 00:01:40,133
Yes, that's him.

46
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,567
You can stay here for now,

47
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,533
but feel free to eat, okay?

48
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:44,733
I'll leave you for a while.

49
00:01:44,867 --> 00:01:47,100
I'll come back for you,
Catalina.

50
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:53,700
What performance
is she talking about?

51
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,767
Shouldn't I be
the one asking that?

52
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:59,300
Didn't you get the invitation?

53
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:01,367
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

54
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:02,567
Oh, don't ask me.

55
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,567
Ask Jin Ho.

56
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:08,233
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

57
00:02:08,367 --> 00:02:10,133
Jin Ho.

58
00:02:10,267 --> 00:02:12,933
Who is this Catalina Esperanza?

59
00:02:13,067 --> 00:02:14,300
<i> Oh...</i>

60
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,567
She's just one of the guests.

61
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,967
Just go with it.

62
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,433
Go with it?

63
00:02:20,033 --> 00:02:22,300
But they said I have to perform.

64
00:02:22,433 --> 00:02:24,433
What if they make me
breathe fire here?

65
00:02:24,567 --> 00:02:26,333
What is this, a carnival?

66
00:02:26,467 --> 00:02:28,000
Wait, let me do something.

67
00:02:28,133 --> 00:02:30,033
- Wait.
- Where are you going?

68
00:02:30,867 --> 00:02:32,233
Wait.

69
00:02:32,967 --> 00:02:34,033
Are you absolutely sure

70
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:36,700
the real Catalina Esperanza

71
00:02:36,833 --> 00:02:38,667
<i> isn't showing up tonight?</i>

72
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:44,600
- [WOMAN WHIMPERING]
- [JIN HO SHUSHING]

73
00:02:44,733 --> 00:02:46,233
<i>It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
</i>[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

74
00:02:46,367 --> 00:02:48,200
[STAMMERS]
<i> I will not hurt you.</i>

75
00:02:48,367 --> 00:02:49,600
<i>You're gonna be okay,
you're gonna be okay.</i>

76
00:02:49,733 --> 00:02:53,867
<i> I will just borrow this and...</i>

77
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,767
<i> this.</i>

78
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,033
<i> So, you're going to be okay.</i>

79
00:02:58,167 --> 00:03:00,467
<i>I'm so sorry.
Thank you so much</i>

80
00:03:01,767 --> 00:03:04,367
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

81
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,467
<i> What?</i>

82
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,600
<i> Where's the invitation?</i>

83
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:13,433
<i> Here.</i>

84
00:03:14,433 --> 00:03:16,967
<i>Ah, she just gave it to you?
Just like that?</i>

85
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:18,600
<i> I just got what we needed.</i>

86
00:03:18,733 --> 00:03:20,200
<i> She kept quiet.</i>

87
00:03:21,767 --> 00:03:23,233
Let's not waste time.

88
00:03:23,367 --> 00:03:25,667
Joey, you're safe.
Don't worry.

89
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:29,867
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

90
00:03:37,733 --> 00:03:39,933
Oh, I also got some for you.

91
00:03:40,067 --> 00:03:41,633
I'm sure you're hungry.

92
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:44,000
You really prioritized that?

93
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,800
What if someone
recognizes us here?

94
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:51,400
Who?

95
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,300
Didn't you notice?
They're all rich people.

96
00:03:54,467 --> 00:03:56,267
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

97
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,833
Good point.

98
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,000
But we really need
to find Golda first,

99
00:04:01,133 --> 00:04:04,167
or our plan will
fall apart again.

100
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,200
So we shouldn't make a scene,

101
00:04:06,333 --> 00:04:08,367
and no one should recognize us.

102
00:04:08,500 --> 00:04:12,900
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

103
00:04:20,933 --> 00:04:24,300
[JAZZ MUSIC PLAYING]

104
00:04:28,367 --> 00:04:30,133
Wow, Ma'am Yvette.

105
00:04:30,267 --> 00:04:32,600
This party is really beautiful.

106
00:04:33,533 --> 00:04:36,500
Where are we meeting
your sponsor?

107
00:04:36,633 --> 00:04:37,833
Do that later.

108
00:04:37,967 --> 00:04:39,333
Enjoy first.

109
00:04:42,667 --> 00:04:43,900
Yvette!

110
00:04:44,033 --> 00:04:45,433
- How are you?
- Hello, hi!

111
00:04:45,567 --> 00:04:47,133
- Good to see you!
- Yes!

112
00:04:47,267 --> 00:04:48,433
Come on, join us!

113
00:04:48,567 --> 00:04:49,733
Meet our friends!

114
00:04:49,867 --> 00:04:50,800
Come here.

115
00:04:50,933 --> 00:04:52,467
Okay.

116
00:04:53,733 --> 00:04:55,167
Hi!

117
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:59,100
Clarissa, have a seat.

118
00:04:59,533 --> 00:05:00,800
Okay.

119
00:05:00,967 --> 00:05:05,033
[JAZZ MUSIC CONTINUES]

120
00:05:12,733 --> 00:05:14,300
- Peter.
- Yes?

121
00:05:14,433 --> 00:05:16,233
Stay here, okay?
Keep watch.

122
00:05:16,367 --> 00:05:17,833
I'll look around.

123
00:05:18,900 --> 00:05:20,167
Be careful.

124
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:22,933
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

125
00:05:23,067 --> 00:05:26,167
Joey, check the guests
you pass by.

126
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:28,133
She might be here.

127
00:05:28,267 --> 00:05:30,667
Okay, but this place is huge.

128
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,700
<i> It'll be hard to find Golda.</i>

129
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:38,933
[CROWD BUZZING]

130
00:05:39,067 --> 00:05:43,033
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

131
00:05:43,733 --> 00:05:47,433
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

132
00:05:51,967 --> 00:05:54,733
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

133
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,967
Boss, your food, Boss.

134
00:05:58,100 --> 00:05:59,233
Thank you.

135
00:05:59,367 --> 00:06:02,433
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

136
00:06:06,667 --> 00:06:07,633
Get away from me.

137
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,333
I'll smash this food
on your face.

138
00:06:10,467 --> 00:06:12,133
Wait, Boss.

139
00:06:12,267 --> 00:06:14,700
I didn't know Trigger
was setting you up.

140
00:06:14,833 --> 00:06:16,767
He really agreed with me.

141
00:06:17,367 --> 00:06:18,767
Yes, Braggy.

142
00:06:18,900 --> 00:06:20,333
He's ready,

143
00:06:20,467 --> 00:06:23,200
and he can't wait to hear your
offer.

144
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,733
Good.

145
00:06:24,867 --> 00:06:27,300
But I'm telling you, Golda...

146
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,567
this negotiation
must never leak.

147
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:34,233
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

148
00:06:34,367 --> 00:06:36,233
What are you talking about?
That won't happen.

149
00:06:36,367 --> 00:06:37,633
Make sure it doesn't.

150
00:06:37,767 --> 00:06:38,867
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

151
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,567
Other groups are already
angry at me

152
00:06:41,733 --> 00:06:43,933
because their clients

153
00:06:44,067 --> 00:06:45,567
are switching to me.

154
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,967
If word gets out...

155
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:49,533
that I've also entered the arms
dealing business

156
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:52,333
and that my clients are
foreigners,

157
00:06:53,067 --> 00:06:54,567
Interpol,

158
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:56,167
<i> Customs,</i>

159
00:06:56,300 --> 00:06:57,533
<i> Manila Task Force,</i>

160
00:06:57,667 --> 00:06:59,667
<i>even the Senate might
get involved.</i>

161
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,700
If this leaks,

162
00:07:02,133 --> 00:07:04,667
you know who I'll come after.

163
00:07:05,667 --> 00:07:07,500
You and your Godfather.

164
00:07:09,033 --> 00:07:11,467
Relax, Braggy, okay?

165
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,167
Nothing will leak.

166
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:15,300
No one will know.

167
00:07:15,467 --> 00:07:16,833
Like, hello?

168
00:07:16,967 --> 00:07:19,733
<i>You're dealing
with someone untouchable.</i>

169
00:07:20,167 --> 00:07:22,500
Even police and military
generals

170
00:07:22,633 --> 00:07:24,233
bow to Godfather.

171
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,533
You know, Braggy,

172
00:07:27,033 --> 00:07:31,167
only an idiot could
ruin this deal.

173
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:35,433
[FOREBODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

174
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,567
Boss...

175
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:42,300
Give me another chance.

176
00:07:42,433 --> 00:07:44,200
Let me find my family,

177
00:07:44,333 --> 00:07:47,633
and I'll handle your meeting
with Trigger again.

178
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,333
Please, Boss.

179
00:07:49,833 --> 00:07:51,967
That's probably
why your wife left you.

180
00:07:52,567 --> 00:07:54,533
Because you're good
at messing things up.

181
00:07:55,033 --> 00:07:57,033
I'm not messing with you, Boss.

182
00:07:57,167 --> 00:07:58,900
Yes.

183
00:07:59,033 --> 00:08:00,367
I cheated on my wife before,

184
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:02,200
but I regret it.

185
00:08:02,333 --> 00:08:05,000
But when I got jailed,
she got back at me.

186
00:08:05,133 --> 00:08:07,867
She went with another man
and took my kids.

187
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:11,200
That's why I'll do everything
to find them.

188
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,900
That's not my problem.

189
00:08:14,667 --> 00:08:16,700
That's harsh, Boss.

190
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:20,633
Like you've never done anything
wrong in your life.

191
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,967
You used to be a tough cop.

192
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,300
Don't tell me you never fooled
around with women?

193
00:08:29,567 --> 00:08:31,200
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

194
00:08:31,333 --> 00:08:34,400
<i> Her name is Golda Briones.</i>

195
00:08:34,533 --> 00:08:36,533
<i> She personally confirmed to me</i>

196
00:08:36,667 --> 00:08:38,867
<i>their secret affair
with Major Delgado.</i>

197
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,133
Maybe you don't recognize me...

198
00:08:41,267 --> 00:08:44,667
But I know you very well.

199
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,000
You destroyed my family!

200
00:08:46,133 --> 00:08:47,433
[SLAPS]

201
00:08:50,067 --> 00:08:52,667
Major Miguel Delgado.

202
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:57,067
Sorry...

203
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:59,667
But I don't deal with losers.

204
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,667
- [SLAPS]
- [GOLDA SHRIEKS]

205
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,800
- You shameless woman!
- [SLAPS]

206
00:09:08,167 --> 00:09:12,300
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

207
00:09:19,867 --> 00:09:22,333
Andrew, I think there are people
over there.

208
00:09:22,933 --> 00:09:24,200
Hey!

209
00:09:24,333 --> 00:09:27,500
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

210
00:09:27,667 --> 00:09:29,400
What are you doing here?

211
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,433
Joey, get out of there!

212
00:09:31,567 --> 00:09:33,633
I'll see if I can get in.

213
00:09:33,767 --> 00:09:37,633
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

214
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,733
The party isn't here.

215
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,267
You've really got some nerve,
don't you?

216
00:09:43,667 --> 00:09:46,433
You already had an affair
with my husband,

217
00:09:46,567 --> 00:09:49,633
and now you're burying him
in a case?

218
00:09:49,767 --> 00:09:51,700
How do you sleep at night?

219
00:09:51,833 --> 00:09:54,533
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

220
00:09:54,667 --> 00:09:56,667
I'm warning you.

221
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,767
I have no conscience left!

222
00:09:59,733 --> 00:10:02,533
You know, maybe I still had
some before,

223
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,467
because I still pitied Miguel.

224
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,533
But you keep ruining my life!

225
00:10:06,667 --> 00:10:07,967
You won't leave me alone!

226
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,133
You keep chasing me!

227
00:10:11,233 --> 00:10:12,600
You know what?
Even if I'm the only hope left

228
00:10:12,733 --> 00:10:14,733
for Miguel to be free,

229
00:10:14,867 --> 00:10:15,800
I don't care anymore.

230
00:10:15,933 --> 00:10:17,233
I will let all of you suffer!

231
00:10:17,367 --> 00:10:18,600
I don't care anymore!

232
00:10:18,733 --> 00:10:20,267
You devil!

233
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,967
- [GOLDA SCREAMING]
- You animal! You animal!

234
00:10:23,100 --> 00:10:24,433
You shameless woman!

235
00:10:24,567 --> 00:10:27,667
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

236
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,933
- This is what you deserve!
- [SCREAMING]

237
00:10:29,067 --> 00:10:30,700
Trash like you!

238
00:10:30,833 --> 00:10:33,433
[SCREAMING CONTINUES]

239
00:10:33,567 --> 00:10:34,800
You shameless woman!

240
00:10:34,967 --> 00:10:36,367
[SHRIEKS]

241
00:10:37,233 --> 00:10:41,133
[SCREAMING]

242
00:10:41,267 --> 00:10:43,067
This is what you deserve!

243
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:46,400
- [SCREAMS]
- You devil!

244
00:10:46,533 --> 00:10:50,633
[WATER SPURTING]

245
00:10:53,267 --> 00:10:54,833
You shameless woman!

246
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:58,333
Dante! Dante!

247
00:10:58,933 --> 00:11:00,300
Godfather is looking for you.

248
00:11:00,433 --> 00:11:01,567
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

249
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:03,467
Okay, tell him we'll follow.

250
00:11:03,867 --> 00:11:05,267
Boys...

251
00:11:06,367 --> 00:11:07,267
Ah, I'm sorry.

252
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,100
I was just looking for the
restroom.

253
00:11:10,267 --> 00:11:12,567
I'll head back now.

254
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:16,233
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

255
00:11:32,433 --> 00:11:34,067
Theresa...

256
00:11:36,567 --> 00:11:38,133
- [GOLDA SCREAMS]
- You animal!

257
00:11:38,267 --> 00:11:39,633
- You wretched woman!
- Clarissa!

258
00:11:39,767 --> 00:11:41,300
Hey, what's this?
Let go of her!

259
00:11:41,467 --> 00:11:43,667
That's enough!
That's enough!

260
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:45,600
Betty, take her outside.

261
00:11:45,733 --> 00:11:48,133
You really have no shame!
Your day will come!

262
00:11:48,267 --> 00:11:50,733
- Homewrecker!
- Hey, that's enough!

263
00:11:52,167 --> 00:11:53,733
Out!

264
00:11:53,867 --> 00:11:54,967
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

265
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:56,367
Who was that?

266
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,233
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

267
00:11:59,367 --> 00:12:01,367
She's my husband's mistress.

268
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,933
I'll have your family located

269
00:12:06,067 --> 00:12:08,067
once I talk to Trigger...

270
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:11,267
and find out
what I need to know.

271
00:12:12,633 --> 00:12:15,433
That's not what we agreed on,
Boss.

272
00:12:16,033 --> 00:12:18,267
I'm only supposed to set up the
meeting between you two.

273
00:12:19,367 --> 00:12:20,500
You don't want to?

274
00:12:20,633 --> 00:12:22,233
Then forget it.

275
00:12:22,367 --> 00:12:23,633
Okay, okay, okay.
I agree, I agree.

276
00:12:23,767 --> 00:12:25,167
Fine, I agree.

277
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:29,567
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

278
00:12:45,333 --> 00:12:46,967
Don't try me.

279
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:49,800
Do you want two groups
coming after you?

280
00:12:53,267 --> 00:12:55,700
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

281
00:12:55,833 --> 00:12:56,800
<i> Joey.</i>

282
00:12:56,933 --> 00:12:59,733
<i>Just wait at the table
with Peter for now.</i>

283
00:12:59,867 --> 00:13:02,733
<i>Jin Ho is finding
a way to get inside.</i>

284
00:13:02,867 --> 00:13:05,300
He'll help you find Golda.

285
00:13:06,467 --> 00:13:08,100
Okay, sure.

286
00:13:16,633 --> 00:13:18,867
Where did Peter go again?

287
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:23,433
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

288
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:26,333
Where is he?

289
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,633
Still no signal.

290
00:13:32,767 --> 00:13:36,167
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

291
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,767
Hello?

292
00:13:48,233 --> 00:13:49,933
I'll just go look for Peter.

293
00:13:50,433 --> 00:13:53,133
They have to get out
of here now.

294
00:13:53,267 --> 00:13:55,500
<i> - Why?
-</i> Theresa is here!

295
00:13:55,667 --> 00:13:57,333
<i> - Joey.
-</i> Andrew?

296
00:13:57,467 --> 00:13:58,767
Can you hear me?

297
00:13:59,167 --> 00:14:00,767
<i> Didn't you hear Jin Ho?</i>

298
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:02,800
Theresa Park is there...

299
00:14:02,933 --> 00:14:05,967
the syndicate member
that is chasing you.

300
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,467
Joey...

301
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,500
you need to leave now.

302
00:14:09,633 --> 00:14:11,033
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

303
00:14:11,167 --> 00:14:12,633
What about Golda?

304
00:14:12,767 --> 00:14:14,567
Joey, there will be another day.

305
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:18,033
Just get out of there, go.

306
00:14:18,167 --> 00:14:19,067
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

307
00:14:22,467 --> 00:14:24,667
Okay, wait a moment.
I'll just look for Peter.

308
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,700
Joey, hurry up.

309
00:14:26,833 --> 00:14:28,533
Come straight here.

310
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:29,900
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

311
00:14:30,033 --> 00:14:32,067
Sorry, Ma'am.
I'm sorry.

312
00:14:33,767 --> 00:14:35,000
Joey?

313
00:14:35,133 --> 00:14:36,233
Joey!

314
00:14:36,367 --> 00:14:38,267
Can you hear me?

315
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,567
Hey, why can't she hear me?

316
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:42,967
[GROANS]

317
00:14:48,300 --> 00:14:52,533
Your husband's imprisonment
is already a weight.

318
00:14:53,433 --> 00:14:54,467
[MELLOW MUSIC PLAYING]

319
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:57,100
I don't really know
how you do it, you know.

320
00:14:57,700 --> 00:15:00,333
You work everyday,

321
00:15:00,467 --> 00:15:03,833
to help other people...

322
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:09,833
while you're quietly
breaking inside.

323
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,433
[SNIFFLES]

324
00:15:14,467 --> 00:15:16,667
I thought, Ma'am...

325
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:20,167
that I had already accepted it.

326
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:22,700
I thought I had already
forgotten.

327
00:15:23,433 --> 00:15:24,767
But when I saw that woman...

328
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:27,167
everything came rushing back.

329
00:15:30,467 --> 00:15:36,333
But when this problem
came out...

330
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:39,267
he still didn't admit it?

331
00:15:42,700 --> 00:15:44,400
No, Ma'am.

332
00:15:46,067 --> 00:15:48,667
Even though there were signs...

333
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:55,600
Like when he stopped
coming home early,

334
00:15:56,567 --> 00:15:58,567
when he said work ran late,

335
00:15:59,567 --> 00:16:01,667
or that he had assignments
in faraway places.

336
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,367
And there was...

337
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:05,967
also the time...

338
00:16:06,100 --> 00:16:10,233
when I smelled a woman's perfume
on his shirt.

339
00:16:10,967 --> 00:16:12,400
But...

340
00:16:14,367 --> 00:16:15,367
Is it really true that she was
his mistress,

341
00:16:15,500 --> 00:16:19,067
or did you confirm it?

342
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:23,900
[MELLOW MUSIC CONTINUES]

343
00:16:25,367 --> 00:16:27,133
Hey, I know this!
Give that to me!

344
00:16:27,267 --> 00:16:28,133
That's my food!
You already took yours...

345
00:16:28,267 --> 00:16:29,767
- the other day!
- You idiot!

346
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:31,633
[CLACKING]

347
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:34,900
- [THUDDING]
- Hey!

348
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:37,967
Hey! Hey!
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

349
00:16:39,367 --> 00:16:41,333
[CLAMORING]

350
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:42,900
That's enough, that's enough!

351
00:16:43,033 --> 00:16:47,033
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

352
00:16:58,433 --> 00:17:01,767
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

353
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,333
I think...

354
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:06,433
I think she dropped
her earpiece.

355
00:17:08,533 --> 00:17:12,600
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

356
00:17:16,067 --> 00:17:18,033
Joey! Joey!

357
00:17:19,833 --> 00:17:21,200
Joey!

358
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,333
Where did you go?

359
00:17:23,467 --> 00:17:25,467
I just went to the restroom.
Is that not allowed?

360
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,733
And I heard something
in the restroom.

361
00:17:28,133 --> 00:17:29,367
I think they were some of
Godfather's men.

362
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:30,400
They were talking about Golda.

363
00:17:30,533 --> 00:17:32,200
And there was another name...

364
00:17:32,333 --> 00:17:33,900
Braganza.

365
00:17:34,467 --> 00:17:35,900
Braganza?

366
00:17:36,333 --> 00:17:37,100
I don't know who that is.

367
00:17:37,233 --> 00:17:38,967
But we need to leave now.

368
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,400
Why?

369
00:17:40,533 --> 00:17:42,567
The syndicate that's been
following us is here.

370
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,500
- It's dangerous now.
- What?

371
00:17:44,967 --> 00:17:45,900
Okay, let's go.

372
00:17:46,033 --> 00:17:47,433
Come on, let's go.

373
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,767
Catalina, you're up next.

374
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,167
- I'm up?
- Yes!

375
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:54,267
You're the opening number,
right?

376
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,100
Come on, come on.

377
00:17:56,233 --> 00:17:57,567
Wait...

378
00:17:58,067 --> 00:18:00,333
What is this?

379
00:18:00,467 --> 00:18:01,933
All right, all right.
There.

380
00:18:02,067 --> 00:18:04,233
There are already many people
waiting for your dance.

381
00:18:04,367 --> 00:18:05,800
Dance?

382
00:18:05,933 --> 00:18:06,900
Are you out of it today?

383
00:18:07,033 --> 00:18:09,100
Why don't you know
what you're supposed to do?

384
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:11,400
Welcome to a night of sparkle,

385
00:18:11,533 --> 00:18:13,433
secrets, and champagne.

386
00:18:13,567 --> 00:18:15,100
Tonight, we don't just celebrate

387
00:18:15,233 --> 00:18:18,167
the 65th birthday
of our beloved Godfather.

388
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:19,967
<i> We step back in time</i>

389
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:23,733
<i>to an era of wild dreams
and wilder parties.</i>

390
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:26,100
Welcome to the roaring twenties,

391
00:18:26,233 --> 00:18:27,800
Gatsby style!

392
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:30,000
You're about to be called.

393
00:18:30,133 --> 00:18:32,433
Do your best, okay?

394
00:18:33,033 --> 00:18:42,967
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

395
00:18:52,100 --> 00:19:02,067
[ALARM BLARING]
[INTENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

396
00:19:20,867 --> 00:19:23,967
Jin Ho, I know
you can still hear me.

397
00:19:24,233 --> 00:19:25,500
Aren't we supposed to be hiding?

398
00:19:25,633 --> 00:19:28,233
Why is there suddenly
dancing like this?

399
00:19:28,733 --> 00:19:30,767
They'll see us.

400
00:19:31,433 --> 00:19:33,133
Joey...
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

401
00:19:33,967 --> 00:19:35,600
I'm sorry.

402
00:19:35,733 --> 00:19:37,367
I didn't know.
I'm...

403
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,100
<i> I'm sorry.</i>

404
00:19:39,233 --> 00:19:41,167
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

405
00:19:41,300 --> 00:19:42,933
They're in trouble.

406
00:19:43,067 --> 00:19:46,233
We need to have a backup plan.

407
00:19:48,067 --> 00:19:49,933
Peter, what should we do?

408
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:52,467
You know what?
You can do it.

409
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:54,567
It's just like TikTak.
Just follow along.

410
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:56,567
What TikTak?

411
00:19:59,433 --> 00:20:00,867
- Andrew...
- What?

412
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,500
Hey, what are you doing?

413
00:20:02,667 --> 00:20:03,967
I'm getting Joey.

414
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:05,600
No, no, no, it's risky.

415
00:20:05,733 --> 00:20:07,200
They will recognize you.

416
00:20:07,333 --> 00:20:08,600
Just let me do it.

417
00:20:08,733 --> 00:20:11,567
The night has just begun,
my friends.

418
00:20:11,700 --> 00:20:15,300
Let's bring in the glitz,
the glamour, and the fun.

419
00:20:15,433 --> 00:20:18,100
So to kick off
our roaring party...

420
00:20:18,233 --> 00:20:20,233
I don't care, okay?
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

421
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:21,833
- Let me go!
- It's dangerous!

422
00:20:21,967 --> 00:20:23,367
Whatever happens, happens!

423
00:20:26,267 --> 00:20:27,933
Andrew!

424
00:20:28,067 --> 00:20:32,033
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

425
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:38,367
Hey, I'm just going
to the restroom, okay?

426
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:39,867
- Sure, sure.
- Thank you.

427
00:20:42,667 --> 00:20:44,000
Ah, excuse me, Sir!

428
00:20:44,133 --> 00:20:45,433
Invite, please.

429
00:20:45,567 --> 00:20:47,033
Invite?
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

430
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,200
I forgot it at home.

431
00:20:49,333 --> 00:20:50,800
Maybe you could just...

432
00:20:50,933 --> 00:20:52,100
let me in?

433
00:20:52,233 --> 00:20:53,467
I'm sorry, Sir,
but we need to see...

434
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:55,500
the actual invitation.

435
00:20:59,267 --> 00:21:01,833
Sir, sorry, but your name
isn't on the invitation list.

436
00:21:01,967 --> 00:21:03,900
Sir, I actually know Godfather.

437
00:21:04,033 --> 00:21:06,333
Maybe you could just let me in,
right?

438
00:21:06,467 --> 00:21:08,733
Stop being stubborn.
I'll shoot you.

439
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,667
The night has just begun,
everyone.

440
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,933
So to kick off
our roaring party,

441
00:21:14,067 --> 00:21:19,133
give it up for the one and only
Catalina Esperanza!

442
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:24,600
[JAZZ MUSIC PLAYING]

443
00:21:28,433 --> 00:21:32,500
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

444
00:21:35,467 --> 00:21:38,000
Braggy, that's wonderful!

445
00:21:38,133 --> 00:21:39,033
Braggy is here.

446
00:21:39,167 --> 00:21:40,333
I know where

447
00:21:40,467 --> 00:21:43,033
that ever-sucking leech Golda
is hiding.

448
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:47,133
She's right here right under my
nose.

449
00:21:47,267 --> 00:21:48,367
I'll handle it.

450
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:49,300
Theresa...

451
00:21:49,433 --> 00:21:51,433
I can't let Theresa
get away again.

452
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,267
Braggy...

453
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:55,700
<i>Let's just say I know what
you've been cooking up</i>

454
00:21:55,833 --> 00:21:57,400
<i> against Godfather.</i>

455
00:21:57,533 --> 00:21:59,167
How did anyone find out about
this transaction of ours?

456
00:21:59,300 --> 00:22:00,533
Liars!

457
00:22:00,667 --> 00:22:02,567
Mom? What are you doing here?

458
00:22:02,700 --> 00:22:04,533
Don't act like an idiot,
Braganza.

459
00:22:04,667 --> 00:22:06,733
You're inside my house.

460
00:22:07,367 --> 00:22:08,533
Let's not leave yet.

461
00:22:08,667 --> 00:22:10,800
- Why?
- Mom is still in there!

462
00:22:10,933 --> 00:22:12,167
Ma'am Yvette!

463
00:22:12,300 --> 00:22:13,400
Boss Idol!

464
00:22:13,533 --> 00:22:15,800
Ma'am Yvette,
Ma'am Yvette isn't here yet.

465
00:22:15,967 --> 00:22:17,433
Where is she?

466
00:22:17,567 --> 00:22:20,067
Don't let her get out alive!
